<h3><u>Tera chehlum karne aayi hu</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Ya abbas ya abbas<br />
mai teri jaageer me aayi hu abbas<br />
<br />
mai shaam se lut kar aayi hu&nbsp;<br />
saugaate masaaeb laayi hu&nbsp;<br />
tera chehlum karne ayi hu<br />
<br />
1. Rudad sunane ko mai sham se ayi hu<br />
ek daag sakina ka is qalb me layi hu<br />
zindan se gam ki qaidi thi&nbsp;<br />
furqat me padar ke roti thi&nbsp;<br />
ro roke sakina jaa se gayi<br />
<br />
2. Lasho se juda hokar us waqt chali zainab<br />
khud ranjo masaeb ki tasweer bani zainab<br />
pathrai hui yeh aankhe thi<br />
pathrili safar ki raahe thi&nbsp;<br />
raaho me faqad ye aahe thi<br />
<br />
3. Mehmil na amaari thi na sar pe mere chadar<br />
mai shaam chali gazi pabande rasan hokar<br />
yaad aaye mujhe fir woh lamhe<br />
humlog watan se jab nikle<br />
mehmil me bithaya tha tune<br />
<br />
4. Kya sakht safar tha woh har gaam tadapti thi<br />
bhai mera naize par mai aag pe chalti thi<br />
the ashk musalsal ankho me<br />
thi rkhaakhe safar hi baalo me<br />
aur naam tera tha laalo me<br />
<br />
5. Yeh ajr risalat ka humlogone paaya tha<br />
aamaad pe aseero ki bazaar sajaya tha<br />
woh lamhe kabhi na bhulungi<br />
darbaar me pahuche jab qaidi<br />
mai yaad tujhe hi karti thi<br />
<br />
6. Darbaar me aye gazi hum par yeh jafae thi<br />
ek simt mera khutba ek simt azaane thi<br />
hakim ne shaki se yeh pucha<br />
hai inme zainab kaun bhala<br />
woh zainab jiska bhai tha<br />
<br />
7. Zinda me aseero ne ek saal guzara hai<br />
us saal ka har lamha ek saal ke jaisa hai<br />
jab hukme rehaai ka aaya<br />
aur loot ka sab saamaan mila<br />
chaadar jo mili zainab ne kaha<br />
<br />
8. Farhan zara socho kya hashra bapa hoga<br />
jab mazhare yazda ki beti ne kaha hoga<br />
zindan se aayi hu dekho<br />
ai shere jari ek baar utho<br />
zainab ka isteqbaal kar</p>
</p>
               
